## Petri dishes

disease-culture-examine-empty = The dish is empty: inoculate it with a swab or a strain vial.
disease-culture-examine-growing = A culture is growing.
disease-culture-examine-ready = The culture has grown and is ready for analysis.
disease-culture-examine-sterile = No colonies have grown: the swab carried no live pathogens.
disease-culture-popup-seeded = The dish is inoculated.
disease-culture-popup-used = The dish is already inoculated.
disease-culture-subject = lab culture
